# Desktop Music Downloader & Library Manager

This document specifies the project vision, architecture, features, tech
stack, API, workflow, and roadmap.

## Overview

Build a modern Electron + React desktop application with a Python
FastAPI backend that wraps an existing Docker-based Apple Music ALAC
downloader. Hide Docker and terminal interactions behind a polished GUI.

## Tech Stack

-   React + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + Electron
-   Python + FastAPI + Docker SDK
-   SQLite + SQLAlchemy
-   Electron Builder

## Architecture

User -\> Electron/React -\> FastAPI -\> Docker SDK -\> Wrapper Container
-\> Downloader Container -\> Downloads

## Features

-   Paste Apple Music URL
-   One-click download
-   Queue management
-   Live progress and logs
-   Download history
-   Local music library
-   Built-in player
-   Settings
-   Notifications
-   Robust error handling

## Backend Modules

app.py, docker_manager.py, download_manager.py, wrapper_manager.py,
library_manager.py, settings.py, database.py, logger.py, progress.py,
models.py, schemas.py, utils.py

## API

GET /health GET /docker/status POST /wrapper/start POST /wrapper/stop
POST /download POST /cancel GET /progress GET /queue GET /history GET
/library GET /logs GET /settings POST /settings

## Workflow

Paste URL -\> Validate -\> Check Docker -\> Start Wrapper -\> Wait Ready
-\> Start Downloader -\> Stream Logs/Progress -\> Save History -\>
Refresh Library -\> Notify User.

## Roadmap

Phase 1: App setup, Docker integration, download. Phase 2: Queue, logs,
settings, history. Phase 3: Library, player, notifications, installer.
Phase 4: Cross-platform, auto updates, optimization.
